        rdfs:comment                   "Silk sewing case, England, 1670s"@en , "Sewing case made out of pale peach and white fabric, possibly a woven silk lining material. Edged with gold coloured silk braid and lined with pale pink silk. Enclosed in the pocket is a piece of folded brown paper attached to which is an unfinished piece of English needlelace (T.287A-1984)."@en ;
